WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.712
Before the final check, here is everything
from this course in one minute.

00:00:04.312 --> 00:00:08.528
HTML says what each part of the
page is. CSS says how it looks.

00:00:08.528 --> 00:00:14.083
And when several rules match the same
element, the cascade picks the one that wins.

00:00:14.683 --> 00:00:19.843
The browser does the rest. It reads your
file, builds the page and draws it, every

00:00:19.843 --> 00:00:22.235
single time. Now take the final check.

